From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sigivb72-netizen <vergilx63@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 06:46:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] podot: ios: iPadOS editor platform integration

- Enable in-process instances in editor builds; relaunch Main in-process
  when the main loop quits (project manager -> editor -> game -> editor),
  re-creating the rendering layer for the new rendering driver.
- Floating Stop control and F8 / Cmd+. to stop a running game; return to
  the editor if iPadOS terminated the app while a game ran.
- Editor data/settings in Application Support, per-project user://.
- Mouse/trackpad: buttons, hover, scroll, pinch, pointer shapes.
- Apple Pencil as a precise mouse with pressure/tilt in the editor
  (opt-in for projects: input_devices/pointing/ios/pencil_as_mouse).
- Hardware keyboard: key repeat, connection change notifications.
- Native file dialogs (UIDocumentPickerViewController) with persisted
  security-scoped bookmarks; Files app integration.
- CoreAudio: activate the audio session when it reports a 0 Hz sample
  rate after a relaunch, instead of falling back to the Dummy driver.
